  "description": "Classic Comfort City Cruiser Bike – Durable Steel Frame, Shimano 3-Speed\nThe classic, curvy bicycle with 15-19-inch durable steel frame. Ideal for casual & comfortable riding around the neighborhood.\nThe Upright riding style keeps your back and shoulders comfortable; Enjoy your every ride with the deluxe Cruiser dual coil spring saddle, wide City aluminum wheels, and handlebar with foam grips.\nBest derailleur brand in the industry: Shimano Nexus Inter 3-Speed and friction shifters makes it easy for tackling uphill climbs and long-distance rides, with front and rear hand brakes.\n700x35-inch wide aluminum wheels 14G Spokes with large waffle tread tires provide a cushioned ride for easy rolling.\nThe bike comes with 85% assembled, easy to finish the assembly.\n\nSADDLE\n\nComfort brown leatherette saddle with springs\n\nPEDALS\n\nOne-piece PP\n\nSHIFTERS\n\nShimano Index 3S35E-3 Speed\n\nFRONT DERAILLEUR\n\nN/A\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nShimano Nexus internal 3-Speed\n\nBRAKE\n\nAlloy dual pivot caliper brakes\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nNECO Cartridge Steel 68x120mm\n\nRIMS\n\nAlloy 700cx36Hx14G Spoke wheelset.\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nAlloy 3/8”x14Gx36H 100x140mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nShimano Nexus internal 3/8”x14Gx36H 120x170mm\n\nSPOKES\n\n14-gauge stainless steel w/ brass\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack, 700x35c\n\nFENDERS\n\nPainted steel fenders with retro brackets and steel braces\n\nEXTRAS\n\nCustom designed rear alloy rack, reflectors, steel kickstand\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
